    {
      "author": "Ingrid Voss",
      "text": "Cutover was the 03-02 file. February partitions ran on v2.3 and stand. Thursday night's run crashed outright, so 03-05 never loaded at all.",
      "ts": "2026-03-09T08:30:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Rei Tanaka",
      "text": "STD's day window Wednesday is free; five attribution partitions at 45 minutes each fit one window. Thursday night is the replication window \u2014 protected.",
      "ts": "2026-03-09T08:39:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Ingrid Voss",
      "text": "Nobody imputes consent fields in SQL, and a full raw-archive rebuild is a separate request to me \u2014 the approval covers the five re-exported days only.",
      "ts": "2026-03-09T08:47:00"
    }
  ],
  "thread_id": "CHAT-0005",
  "title": "DATA-0005 Cormorant schema cutover"
}

